<#
.SYNOPSIS
  Arc Posture Review - security assessment for Azure Arc (READ-ONLY) - v4.0.1
.DESCRIPTION
  Generated by Arc Posture Review. Each dataset is a paginated query
  to Azure Resource Graph (no per-machine loop) or one call per subscription.
  Does not create, change, or remove resources: commands not on the read list are blocked.
  Output: <OutputRoot>/arc-posture-review-<data>/ with summary.md, results.json, findings/*.csv,
  data/*.json, run.log, manifest.json (SHA-256), and the corresponding .zip.
.NOTES
  Requirements: authenticated Azure CLI (az login) and Reader role in the scope
  (Reader also covers Defender for Cloud). Recommended: Azure Cloud Shell (PowerShell).
  V4 report (default; skip with -NoV4Report): after the package, clones the release tag matching this
  version from GitHub, renders the v4 report next to the .zip and compresses it as <run>-v4.zip
  (requires git and Python 3.10+; if missing, the collection is unaffected and the manual command is printed).
#>
